#strong[Critical minerals]: The DRC produces about 70% of the world's
cobalt; China refines most of the world's lithium, cobalt, and graphite
and dominates rare-earth processing. India's response: MMDR Amendment
Act 2023 listed 24 critical and strategic minerals for Union auction;
the National Critical Mineral Mission (Cabinet, January 2025) with
₹16,300 crore from the Government plus about ₹18,000 crore expected from
PSUs.

